{"title":"위국일기","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=bsNEbA/hAHIrMRr0b/wh5rmaf8PS9fJrLKykNAKk&filename=th3","synopsis":"소설가 코다이 마키오(35)는 언니 부부의 장례식에서 고아가 된 언니의 딸 아사(15)를 친척들이 서로 떠넘기는 것을 보고, 발끈하여 충동적으로 자신이 맡겠다고 나선다. 그러나 바로 다음 날, 아침에 눈을 뜨자마자 타고난 극도의 낯가림이 발동! 타인과 함께 생활하는 걸 불편해하는 자신의 성격을 그만 깜빡했던 것이었다…. \n반면, 아사는 낯가림은커녕 ‘어른답지 않은 어른’ 마키오와의 생활을 아무 거리낌 없이 자연스레 받아들이는데….\n낯가림 심한 이모&혼자 남겨진 조카. 둘이 함께 더듬더듬 그려가는 세대차이 동거일기. \n\nIKOKU NIKKIⓒTomoko Yamashita/SHODENSHA Publishing Co., Ltd.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":195,"change":{"type":"up","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":227,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":241,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":216,"change":{"type":"up","amount":25}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":190,"change":{"type":"up","amount":26}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":238,"change":{"type":"down","amount":48}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":215,"change":{"type":"up","amount":23}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":232,"change":{"type":"down","amount":17}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":235,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":215,"change":{"type":"up","amount":20}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":179,"change":{"type":"up","amount":36}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":272,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":232,"change":{"type":"up","amount":40}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":225,"change":{"type":"up","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-09-05","rank":286,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-06","rank":196,"change":{"type":"up","amount":90}},{"date":"2026-09-07","rank":204,"change":{"type":"down","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-09-09","rank":244,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-10","rank":224,"change":{"type":"up","amount":20}},{"date":"2026-09-12","rank":259,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-14","rank":256,"change":{"type":"n